

Split main.py into a package (e.g. app/ or runner/) with modules like:
runner/cli_args.py (argparse only)
runner/session.py (start/stop, emotion switching, seed handling)
runner/ui_realtime_cli.py (interactive commands)
runner/offline.py (export/training entrypoints)

Make generation components swappable behind interfaces:
Composer (arrangement / section plan)
Generator (melody/chords/arp/bass event generation)
Renderer (sampler + FX + mastering)
Player (realtime buffering, underflow policy) Then new features (new model,
new rhythm engine, new arrangement policy) become “add one module” instead of
 “touch 12 files”.

